

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Pwogram jesyon-memwa: 0.

>> f := Fichye nouvo: ['/tmp/citrine_test_file.txt'].
f exists: { f efase. }.
f ekri: ['hello '].
f ajoute-nan-fen: ['world'].
>> q := f li-done.
Sòti ekri: q, nouvo-liy.

Pwogram netwaye.
usedMemory1 := (Pwogram memwa ? 0).

